# Cards with weight, and cards with verbs.
#
# Two things land here at once, and they are the same argument from either end. A column of
# cards drawn at one weight has no shape - Link and Mesh sat side by side with nothing to say
# which one to read first - so a card now states one of three variants, which on a panel with no
# alpha to cast a shadow into is one of three surface tiers. And a card that reports on
# something is where the verb about it belongs: disconnecting used to mean walking to the
# Devices tab to press X on a card that was already naming the radio.
#
# Watch three things: the fills, the ring, and the bar. The Link card is a step off the ground
# and always is - it answers the screen's first question. The Radio card is outlined while it
# has nothing to report and lifts to the raised tier the moment it does, which is the same fact
# its heading colour was carrying alone. And Up/Down walks the verbs rather than the cards, so
# the focus ring moves between panels and the action bar renames A as it goes.

scene demo
delay 260
config

tab status
hold 1100

# Down to the Radio card's verb. The ring follows, the button fills, and "A disconnect" in the
# bar becomes "A refresh" - one table read twice, which is what stops the two disagreeing.
key down
hold 1400
key up
hold 900

# The radio comes under pressure. Every row on that card exists only while something is wrong,
# which is why it recedes when nothing is - and why it lifts here without a row having to be
# read. The heading tone and the variant are two readings of one fact.
queue 6 16
hold 700
notice warn Duty cycle limit reached, transmit paused
hold 900
queue 0 16 refused
hold 900
reboots 2
hold 1200

# The same three weights in every theme. A variant is a surface role and the ring is a tone, so
# nothing here is switched by hand - and on the contrast theme, where all three tiers are within
# a shade of the ground, the hairline is the whole of what says a card is there.
theme light
hold 1200
theme contrast
hold 1200
theme colorblind
hold 1600
